62 stats, 36 skills, 6 heroes, 132 attributes, 108 passives, 8 pets, 61 monsters, 197 runes, 100 levels, 30 stages,
drop chain; en-US localization. 535 item + 39 rune icons. Premium dashboard; full-catalog **Codex** (owned-marked,
drop sources/box contents, audit 100% / 6177); Party "who's carrying" source breakdown; real hero XP-to-next
(LevelInfoData calibrated); Loot/Player.log (boxes, offline rewards, rare alerts); **History/Trends** from save backups;
offline-rewards card (cap LEARNED from logs, TZ-corrected). Packaging: NSIS installer + electron-updater + GitHub Pages
(HTTPS); Releases v1.0.0 & v1.0.1 published. Fully responsive. Vercel-ready (vercel.json + index.html).

## DEFERRED — golden rule (leave a note, never guess)
Live DPS / clear-time / per-hero DPS share (need game memory = CodeStage [ACTk] ban risk — the new per-stage gold/hr is
the SAVE-ONLY answer and includes idle by construction); per-stage XP/hr (no calibrated lifetime-XP aggregate; stage
kills/hr is the measured proxy); Steam Market value (Inventory Service throttled/empty this build); 12-min blue-chest
(no 720s in DropCooldown); per-item origin — craft vs drop vs market-buy (no flag, not logged); "Cube gold" alone
(bundled in the ~0.5% "other" gold bucket); uncalibrated aggregate Types 16/4/5/7/9/10/15; Korean ItemGroup names;
per-item drop %. Optional follow-ups: Codex recipes/set bonuses; sign the installer (cert); Clerk auth on the crew API.

## GOLDEN RULE
A helper, never game-breaking. Read-only always (CodeStage anti-cheat). No fabricated data — every label calibrated from
the game's own tables/localization; honest fallback or omit. Verify EVERY change vs the LIVE save (Node + headless, all
11 tabs, 0 console errors). The crew leaderboard is OPT-IN only and never receives the save.

